[00:36.16]I'm loving you
[00:37.91]我为你追赶 也不苦
[00:41.86]I'm loving you
[00:44.56]空等 也不顾
[00:47.86]I'm loving you
[00:49.44]I love you
[00:50.49]I love you
[00:51.59]I love you
[00:53.50]I'm loving you
[00:55.98]得到够多 幸运 饰演我
